Job Title: Senior Android Developer
Experience: 5 to 10 Years
Location: Chennai / Pune
Employment Type: Full-Time

Job Summary
We are looking for a highly skilled and passionate Android Developer with 5-10 years of experience in designing, developing, and maintaining high-performance Android applications. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Android development, modern architecture patterns, and a deep understanding of mobile application lifecycle management.

Key Responsibilities

Design, develop, test, and maintain Android applications.
Collaborate with product managers, UX/UI designers, and backend teams to build scalable mobile solutions.
Write clean, maintainable, and efficient code following Android best practices.
Implement new features while ensuring application performance, quality, and responsiveness.
Troubleshoot, debug, and resolve production issues.
Integrate RESTful APIs and third-party libraries/services.
Participate in code reviews and contribute to technical design discussions.
Optimize applications for maximum speed, performance, and scalability.
Stay updated with the latest Android technologies and industry trends.

Required Skills

5-10 years of experience in Android application development.
Strong proficiency in Kotlin and Java.
Hands-on experience with Android SDK, Android Studio, and Gradle.
Strong knowledge of MVVM, Clean Architecture, and Design Patterns.
Experience with Jetpack Components (Room, Navigation, ViewModel, LiveData, WorkManager).
Experience with Jetpack Compose.
Expertise in REST API integration and JSON parsing.
Strong understanding of Git and version control systems.
Experience with unit testing and UI testing frameworks.
Good understanding of mobile security best practices.

Preferred Skills

Experience with CI/CD pipelines.
Knowledge of Firebase services (Analytics, Crashlytics, Push Notifications).
Exposure to Agile/Scrum methodologies.
Experience in publishing and maintaining applications on the Google Play Store.
Knowledge of dependency injection frameworks such as Hilt/Dagger.
Educational Qualification
Bachelor's or Master's degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or related field.

Soft Skills

Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.
Excellent communication and collaboration abilities.
Ability to work independently and in a fast-paced environment.
Mentoring experience is an added advantage.
Location Preference: Candidates should be willing to work from Chennai or Pune